Description: Simulates, fits and plots models of enzyme and binding
    kinetics: Michaelis-Menten and its variants, substrate inhibition,
    reversible inhibition, two-substrate (ternary-complex and ping-pong),
    Hill and binding models. Models are fitted by nonlinear least squares,
    with profile likelihood or asymptotic confidence intervals and fit
    statistics, and plotted with or without linearising transformations
    (Lineweaver-Burk, Hanes, Eadie-Hofstee and the direct linear plot).
    enzKinet2 powers the EKA2 web app <https://eka.nz>.
